					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040804
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741040804,
					"content": "唔，好像不太對…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040801
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741040805,
					"content": "試試看牢籠旁邊的終端。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040806
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741040806,
					"content": "讓我看看…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741040807,
					"content": "從這裡可以看到奎瑟爾離開的門，那接下來該怎麼辦呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040808,
						741040810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741040808,
					"content": "啟動牢籠邊的儲能裝置。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040809
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741040809,
					"content": "唔唔，從這個視角好像看不到…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741040810,
					"content": "啟動門邊的儲能裝置。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040811
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741040811,
					"content": "好呦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741040812,
					"content": "門上的端末亮起來了！從那邊應該能看到不同的畫面吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741040813,
					"content": "從這邊可以看到比較大的門！那接下來該怎麼辦？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040814,
						741040816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741040814,
					"content": "回到對面端末的視角。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040815
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741040815,
					"content": "欸？好吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741040818,
					"content": "從這裡可以看到奎瑟爾離開的門，那接下來該怎麼辦呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040819,
						741040821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741040819,
					"content": "啟動牢籠邊的儲能裝置。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040820
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741040820,
					"content": "唔唔，從這個視角好像看不到…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741040821,
					"content": "回到對面端末的視角。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040822
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741040822,
					"content": "欸？好吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741040816,
					"content": "啟動牢籠邊的儲能裝置。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040817
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741040817,
					"content": "交給我吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741040823,
					"content": "成功了！怎麼樣？我也是可以幫上忙的，對吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741040824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741040824,
					"content": "話說回來，奎瑟爾那傢伙到底是怎麼回事？真搞不懂…我們往他離開的方向找找看吧！說不定可以發現什麼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
